{"id":"vod_sn_38641","vodId":"38641","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"舞动青春 动画","name_cn":"舞动青春 动画","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/767d89b351adfc00106c332a657edbaf.jpg"},"summary":"富士田多多良（土屋神叶 配音）是一个平凡的初中三年级男生，多多良对未来没有什么规划，亦没有确切坚定的人生梦想，终日生活在懵懂之中。一场意外中，多多良遇见了名为仙石要（森川智之 配音）的男子，在后者的带领下，他来到了名为小笠原的舞蹈工作室，在那里，多多良第一次感受到了社交舞蹈的强烈魅力，就此踏入了这个充满了激情世界之中。　　表面冷淡内心火热的兵藤清春（冈本信彦 配音）、多多良的同学，清春的舞伴花冈雫（佐仓绫音 配音）、大大咧咧强势开朗的赤城贺寿（富田健太郎 配音）、善解人意温柔体贴的赤城真子（诸星堇 配音），在工作室里，多多良邂逅了这些志同道合的舞者们，他们是彼此较量的对手，更是分享着共同的理想和热情的同伴。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/heyDDKYau81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rREq06EsDk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vAvdzXMBvD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P434YksWyP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3C82sGyi7V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M0YPuprQhn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xNa2ic04TZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vCpRR72uzR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KkxuwqAD481/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LaxSgfPhmj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DSEKj0Qf3f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dEFAme2qjN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0mU9Yxwtw11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EYUHNkHs4F1/video/in